# Conversion output. Large: a 160-page 10-K produces a 10-30 MB JSON, and the
# per-batch resume files are roughly the same again. Share these as an archive,
# not through git.
# All conversion output lands here. Do not add bare *.json / *.md rules —
# they silently swallow the repo's own documentation.
out/

